Tiger Brands structures its sustainability approach around three pillars: health and nutrition, aimed at helping consumers improve their wellbeing through affordable good nutrition; enhanced livelihoods, intended to improve conditions for the many people connected to its supply chain; and caring for the environment. The Waltloo facility forms part of the manufacturing base supporting this national food and beverage business. Retailers and consumers across South Africa encounter Tiger Brands products manufactured in part through facilities such as this Waltloo site in Pretoria.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.tigerbrands.com/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tiger-food-brands-ltd-bergtuin' AND description = 'Tiger Food Brands Ltd operates a manufacturing facility in Waltloo as part of Tiger Brands, a major South African food and beverage company known for brands such as Oros, focused on providing affordable, quality nutrition.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
  AND owner_user_id IS NULL AND COALESCE(subscription_tier, 0) = 0 AND COALESCE(origin, '') != 'owner_submitted'
  AND status = 'published' AND closed_at IS NULL AND is_test = 0
  AND custom_blocks IS NULL AND page_html IS NULL
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_claims c WHERE c.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM subscriptions s WHERE s.business_id = businesses.id)
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM business_photos p WHERE p.business_id = businesses.id);
-- tm-global-forwarding-pty-ltd-clubview (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'TM Global Forwarding (Pty) Ltd is a Clubview-based freight and logistics company offering air, sea and road freight, cargo courier, customs clearing and household removal services, drawing on more than 20 years of industry relationships. The company takes a personal rather than technical approach to shipping, assigning a single team member to see a client''s cargo through from origin to destination instead of passing it between departments.

Its packing service covers pallets and crates, temperature-sensitive packing, professional packing for household moves, and specialised rigging or crane hire for awkward or heavy items. On customs clearing, TM Global Forwarding handles both import and export clearing in South Africa and in most other countries, assists with SADC certificates, and guides clients through SARS registration for import and export licences even though it is not itself a licensing service. Businesses and individuals needing freight, customs clearing or household removals, handled by a dedicated point of contact, can work with this Clubview-based forwarder.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://tmgf.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tm-global-forwarding-pty-ltd-clubview' AND description = 'TM Global Forwarding (Pty) Ltd is a Clubview-based freight and logistics company offering air, sea and road freight, cargo courier, customs clearing and household removal services, drawing on more than 20 years of industry relationships.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
