Beyond waterproofing itself, the company installs and repairs barge and fascia boards, which protect a roof''s timber edges from the elements while giving a clean finish, and offers seamless gutter installation alongside ongoing gutter maintenance and repairs. Ceiling installations and Isotherm insulation services extend the business into the inside of the roof space, not just its waterproofing. The business is open Monday to Friday from 8am to 5pm and Saturdays from 8am to 2pm, closed Sundays, serving Villieria and the wider Pretoria area for roofing, waterproofing and related repair work.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'http://www.toproofwaterproofing.co.za/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'top-roof-waterproofing-villieria' AND description = 'Top Roof Waterproofing is a roofing and waterproofing specialist in Villieria, Pretoria, handling tiled and iron-roof waterproofing, torch-on flat roofs, roof painting, gutters, ceilings and insulation, backed by a 5-year guarantee on its waterproofing work.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
